	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et pacem a deo patre per Christum, dominum nostrum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Redditę mihi sunt, amantissime pater, literę <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>tuę, quas magno cum gaudio recepi, maiore perlegi, cum maximo relegi.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quid enim, si <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>non hęc iuvant, vos valere omnes, religionem religiose observari, tranquillam esse rempublicam, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>a terrore etiam corporalis pestis liberatos esse cumque fratribus longo iam tempore nec parum <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>suspectos in gratiam atque consensum rectum rediisse?</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Deum optimum maximum oro, ut vobis <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>hęc omnia donet perpetua, amen.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">non ignoras unicas <placeName ref="l49">Biellnas</placeName> cum vobis ac <placeName ref="l41">Ber<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>natibus</placeName> constanter munera corruptionis respuere.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="de">Danck heig noch das un<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>achtbar <placeName ref="l49">Biele</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Promissa fuerat auri dimida pars, quod traditur singulo Pago; <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>verum neque dimidium neque integrum est admissum.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Deus nos confirmet in omni proposito bono <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>atque clementer custodiat, ne paucorum avaritia et multorum hypocrisis totum cor<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>pus disperdat, inquinet ac dissipet.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Vestram et <placeName ref="l832">Gallorum</placeName> confessionem per hunc <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>tabellionem expecto.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Valemus recte omnes praeter D. <persName>Iacobum</persName>, qui perpetua infirmitate <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>languet atque consumitur.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutat te mea vicissim; salutant fratres, quos et tu sal<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>vere iussisti.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutem ex me tuis omnibus dicito et D. <persName ref="p8011">Gualthero</persName>.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l49">Biellnis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>14. kalendas novembris 1549.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Totus ex animo tuus <persName ref="p8082">Ioannes <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Leopoldus Fry</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Eximio viro D. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesię ministro dignissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>patri colendissimo suo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
